      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 74 Cook Street to the Dublin 8 property market. Situated in the very heart of the city, this charming three-bedroom residence offers an exceptional opportunity for buyers seeking a home with immense potential in one of Dublin's most sought-after and historic locations. Combining character, convenience and endless possibilities, this property is ideally suited to those looking to enjoy all that vibrant Dublin city living has to offer.\nThe location is second to none, with Christchurch Cathedral, Temple Bar, St. Stephen's Green and the Guinness Storehouse all within easy walking distance. Residents are spoiled with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and leisure facilities right on their doorstep, while a host of cultural attractions, parks and entertainment venues further enhance the appeal of this superb address. Excellent public transport links, including the Luas and numerous bus routes, ensure seamless access to every corner of the city and beyond, making this an ideal location for both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\nInternally, the property extends to approximately 54 sq.m. and boasts a well-proportioned layout throughout. The ground floor comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a bright and comfortable living room, a kitchen area, a main bathroom and a spacious double bedroom. Upstairs, there are two further generous double bedrooms, providing ample accommodation and flexibility to suit a variety of purchasers, whether first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a centrally located investment property.\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private outdoor area, a valuable and increasingly rare feature in this prime city centre setting. This space offers excellent potential for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying a peaceful retreat away from the bustle of the city.\nWhile the property would benefit from some minor cosmetic modernisation, it represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to create a home tailored to their own taste and style. With its unbeatable location, well-balanced accommodation and superb potential, No. 74 Cook Street is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers.\n\nKey Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Approx. 54 sqm.</li>\n <li>BER F</li>\n <li>3 Bed / 1 Bath</li>\n <li>All bedrooms are generous doubles</li>\n <li>Ground floor bedroom</li>\n <li>Private rear outdoor area</li>\n <li>Fantastic potential</li>\n <li>Minor cosmetic upgrades required</li>\n <li>Gas central heating</li>\n <li>Prime Dublin 8 location</li>\n <li>Every conceivable amenity on your doorstep</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers and investors</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections\nEircode - D08 F2H2"
      },
      {
